      "message": "So anything that depends on this target will essentially no be able to use `attach` in any useful way, since the only thing available will be `GL`? And won\u0027t be able to build it with support for more backends?\n\nThe point of this design was to support multiple backends at a time and switch between them at runtime. This is application code and not library code, so it should be file to add a bunch of configuration stuff here (and default it to something sane per platform).",
