      "writtenOn": "2024-08-06T17:25:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think what you are suggestion is that we have something like:\n- on Linux, bundle in Ganesh GL and Vulkan (eventually Graphite) and let viewer or whatever switch\n- on Mac, bundle in Gaensh GL and Metal (eventually Graphite) and ...\netc?\n\nInstead of having one-off per backend? That seems reasonable to me. Do you want that handled here at least to get things started or in a follow-up CL?",
