      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. Also, since this is application code and not really library code so adding build time flags if needed would be fine here. Mostly I wanted to avoid setting thing up like they are here were it seems to preclude or make more difficult having all the backends in one application. In particular a `viewer_ganesh_gl` target isn\u0027t what we want, we really do want jut one `viewer` built at a time with everything it can have in it by default, and maybe flags to add even more if we can.\n\nIt would be interesting to have `sk_app` be more library-ish maybe, but I don\u0027t think that\u0027s a real goal. I think that would take quite a bit of slicing a dicing of the existing code.",
